    "content_html": "<h5><span><b>Crash Rates at Intersections:</b></span></h5>\r\n<div class=\"text-center\">\r\n<button type=\"button\" class=\"btn btn-light shadow-lg\">$RMEV = \\dfrac{A \\times 1,000,000}{V}$ <span class=\"text-muted\">&emsp; &emsp; &emsp; Page 306</span></button>\r\n</div><br/>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n<h5><span><b>Crash Rates for Roadway Segments:</b></span></h5>\r\n<div class=\"text-center\">\r\n<button type=\"button\" class=\"btn btn-light shadow-lg\">$RMVM = \\dfrac{A \\times 1,000,000}{VMT}$ <span class=\"text-muted\">&emsp; &emsp; &emsp; Page 306</span></button>\r\n</div><br/>\r\n\r\n\r\n<h5><span><b>Crash Reduction:</b></span></h5>\r\n<div class=\"text-center\">\r\n<button type=\"button\" class=\"btn btn-light shadow-lg\">$\\mathrm{Crashes\\ Prevented} = N \\times CR \\times \\dfrac{\\mathrm{ADT\\ after\\ improvement}}{\\mathrm{ADT\\ before\\ improvement}}$ <span class=\"text-muted\">&emsp; &emsp; &emsp; Page 307</span></button>\r\n</div><br/>\r\n\r\n\\[CR = CR_1 + (1 - CR_1) CR_2 + (1 - CR_1)(1 - CR_2) CR_3 + ....\\]",
