    "discipline": "Civil",
    "subject": "Construction Engineering",
    "chapter": "Project Controls",
    "topic": "Activity Relationships",
    "subtopic": "Overview",
    "content_html": "<div class=\"container-fluid\">\r\n\t<div class=\"row align-items-start\">\r\n\t\t<div class=\"col col-lg-8\">\r\n\r\nThere are four types of activity relationships in project management:\r\n<ol>\r\n<li>Finish-to-Start (FS): The successor activity cannot start until the predecessor activity is completed.</li>\r\n<li>Start-to-Start (SS): The successor activity cannot start until the predecessor activity begins.</li>\r\n<li>Finish-to-Finish (FF): The successor activity cannot be completed until the predecessor activity is completed.</li>\r\n<li>Start-to-Finish (SF): The successor activity cannot be completed until the predecessor activity begins.</li>\r\n</ol>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"text-center\">\r\n<button type=\"button\" class=\"btn btn-light shadow-lg\">$\r\n\\begin{align*}\r\nES &= \\mathrm{Early\\ start} = \\mathrm{Latest\\ EF\\ of\\ predecessors}\\\\\r\nEF &= \\mathrm{Early\\ finish} = \\mathrm{ES + duration}\\\\\r\nLS &= \\mathrm{Late\\ start} = \\mathrm{LF - duration}\\\\\r\nLF &= \\mathrm{Late\\ finish} = \\mathrm{Earliest\\ LS\\ of\\ successors}\\\\\r\nD &= \\mathrm{Duration}\\\\\r\n\\mathrm{Float} &= LS - ES \\mathrm{\\ or\\ } LF - EF\\\\\r\n\\end{align*}\r\n\r\n$ <span class=\"text-muted\">&emsp; &emsp; &emsp; Page 310</span></button>\r\n</div><br/>\r\n\r\n\t\t</div>\r\n    \t\t<div class=\"col\">\r\n     <center><img src=\"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/f/f3/Activity-on-node_diagram_showing_SS_relationship_drag_computation.png\" alt=\"Activity Relationships\" style=\"max-width: 50vh;\"><br/>\r\n<small><small><a href=\"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Activity-on-node_diagram_showing_SS_relationship_drag_computation.png\">Nuggetkiwi</a>, <a href=\"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/3.0\">CC BY-SA 3.0</a>, via Wikimedia Commons</small></small></center><br/>\r\n    \t\t</div>\r\n  \t</div>\r\n</div>",
    "important": "",
    "resources": "<div class=\"mt-4 pt-4 border-t border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-700 flex flex-wrap gap-2\"><a href=\"https://drive.google.com/file/d/1otE2ZLooA8I3jHgiAaZg1vdwTREga9Zr/preview\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"px-3 py-1.5 bg-purple-100 dark:bg-purple-900/40 text-purple-700 dark:text-purple-300 rounded text-xs font-bold hover:bg-purple-200 transition-colors\">👨‍🏫 Tutoring</a></div>",
