    "discipline": "Civil",
    "subject": "Construction Engineering",
    "chapter": "Project Controls",
    "topic": "Earned Value",
    "subtopic": "Overview",
    "content_html": "<div class= \"container-fluid\">\r\n  <div class= \"row align-items-start\">\r\n    <div class=\"col col-lg-8\">\r\n <h5><span><b>Earned Value Basic Performance Metrics:</b></span></h5>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Cost Variance : Difference between projected cost and actual\r\ncost. </li>\r\n<div class=\"text-center\">\r\n<button type=\"button\" class=\"btn btn-light shadow-lg\">$CV = BCWP - ACWP$ <span class=\"text-muted\">&emsp; &emsp; &emsp; Page 310</span></button>\r\n</div><br/>\r\n\r\n<li>Schedule Variance : Difference between projected schedule and actual schedule.</li>\r\n<div class=\"text-center\">\r\n<button type=\"button\" class=\"btn btn-light shadow-lg\">$SV = EV -PV$ <span class=\"text-muted\">&emsp; &emsp; &emsp; Page 310</span></button>\r\n</div><br/>\r\n\r\n<li><p>Cost Performance Index :A measure of how close the project is to spend on the work performed to what was planned to have been spent.</li>\r\n<div class=\"text-center\">\r\n<button type=\"button\" class=\"btn btn-light shadow-lg\">$CPI = \\dfrac{BCWP}{ACWP}$ <span class=\"text-muted\">&emsp; &emsp; &emsp; Page 311</span></button>\r\n</div><br/>\r\n\r\n\r\n<li>Schedule Performance Index : A measure of how close the project is to performing work as it was actually scheduled. </li>\r\n<div class=\"text-center\">\r\n<button type=\"button\" class=\"btn btn-light shadow-lg\">$SPI = \\dfrac{BCWP}{BCWS}$ <span class=\"text-muted\">&emsp; &emsp; &emsp; Page 311</span></button>\r\n</div><br/>\r\n\r\n</ul>\r\n  \r\n    </div>\r\n    <div class=\"col\">\r\n <center><p><img src=\"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/c/c6/Earned_Value_Concept.jpg\" style=\"max-width: 50vh;\"></p><br/>\r\n<small><small><a href=\"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Earned_Value_Concept.jpg\">US gov</a>, Public domain, via Wikimedia Commons</small></small></center><br/>\r\n\r\n\r\n    </div>\r\n  </div>\r\n</div>",
    "important": "",
    "resources": "",
    "images": [],
    "local_images": [],
    "video": "https://drive.google.com/file/d/1Yj6J0YXq33t1p3w45duF59-oqnJHRxSD/preview",
    "videoTitle": "Earned Value"
