    "discipline": "Civil",
    "subject": "Dynamics",
    "chapter": "Kinematics of Particles",
    "topic": "Instantaneous Velocity and Acceleration",
    "subtopic": "Overview",
    "content_html": "<div class=\"container-fluid\">\r\n\t<div class=\"row align-items-start\">\r\n\t\t<div class=\"col col-lg-6\">\r\n<p>The instantaneous velocity is obtained as follows: <span class=\"math display\">\\[\\vec{v} = \\lim_{\\Delta t \\to 0}\\dfrac{\\Delta s}{\\Delta t}\\]</span> Or, if s = f(t) then v = <span class=\"math inline\">\\(\\dfrac{d}{dt}f(t)\\)</span> = f’(t)<br />\r\nThe instantaneous acceleration is obtained as follows: <span class=\"math display\">\\[\\vec{a} = \\lim_{\\Delta t \\to 0}\\dfrac{\\Delta v}{\\Delta t}\\]</span> Or, if v = g(t) then a = <span class=\"math inline\">\\(\\dfrac{d}{dt}g(t)\\)</span> = <span class=\"math inline\">\\(\\dfrac{d^2}{dt^2}f(t)\\)</span></p>\r\n\r\n\r\n<p>displacement $\\leftrightharpoons$ velocity $\\leftrightharpoons$ acceleration</p>\r\n\r\n<p>When you go right, take derivative with reference to time.</p>\r\n<p>when you go left, take integration with reference to time.</p>\r\n\r\n\t\t</div>\r\n    \t\t<div class=\"col\">\r\n     <center><p><img src=\"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/4/40/US_Navy_040501-N-1336S-037_The_U.S._Navy_sponsored_Chevy_Monte_Carlo_NASCAR_leads_a_pack_into_turn_four_at_California_Speedway.jpg\" style=\"max-width: 50vh;\"></p><br/>\r\n<small><small><a href=\"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:US_Navy_040501-N-1336S-037_The_U.S._Navy_sponsored_Chevy_Monte_Carlo_NASCAR_leads_a_pack_into_turn_four_at_California_Speedway.jpg\">U.S. Navy photo by Chief Journalist Erik Schneider.</a>, Public domain, via Wikimedia Commons</small></small></center>\r\n    \t\t</div>\r\n  \t</div>\r\n</div>",
    "important": "\\[\\vec{v} = \\lim_{\\Delta t \\to 0}\\dfrac{\\Delta s}{\\Delta t}\\]\r\n\\[\\vec{a} = \\lim_{\\Delta t \\to 0}\\dfrac{\\Delta v}{\\Delta t}\\]",
    "resources": "<div class=\"mt-4 pt-4 border-t border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-700 flex flex-wrap gap-2\"><a href=\"https://drive.google.com/file/d/1t_P0ozmf8IlnajRLyhlQmfhnIHDOmC77/preview\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"px-3 py-1.5 bg-blue-100 dark:bg-blue-900/40 text-blue-700 dark:text-blue-300 rounded text-xs font-bold hover:bg-blue-200 transition-colors\">📄 Homework</a><a href=\"https://drive.google.com/file/d/1fvQWePO1Z6ZCT5TIDBhkc4ZB70iU3iAd/preview\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"px-3 py-1.5 bg-green-100 dark:bg-green-900/40 text-green-700 dark:text-green-300 rounded text-xs font-bold hover:bg-green-200 transition-colors\">✅ Solution</a><a href=\"https://drive.google.com/file/d/1KI4YK6t5-Q_PHKbJ2ToGTNcUbygw5V3c/preview\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"px-3 py-1.5 bg-purple-100 dark:bg-purple-900/40 text-purple-700 dark:text-purple-300 rounded text-xs font-bold hover:bg-purple-200 transition-colors\">👨‍🏫 Tutoring</a></div>",
