    "content_html": "Professional and technical societies have following functions:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Promote development of professional excellence.</li>\r\n<li>Raise public awareness in their domains.</li>\r\n<li>Encourage research by publishing professional journals.</li>\r\n<li>Recognize high standards of quality by recognizing achievements.</li>\r\n<li>Help develop technical codes and standards.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\nSome examples of Professional and technical societies are:\r\n<ul>\r\n\t<li>American Society of Mechanical Engineers</li>\r\n\t<li>Institution of Mechanical Engineers</li>\r\n\t<li>International Academy for Production Engineering (CIRP)</li>\r\n\t<li>Society of Automotive Engineers</li>\r\n\t<li>Society of Manufacturing Engineers</li>\r\n</ul>",
