    "chapter": "Licensure",
    "topic": "Licensure",
    "subtopic": "Overview",
    "content_html": "<h5><span><b>Benefits of Licensure:</b></span></h5>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Career Enhancement and Progression:</li>\r\n<li>Title</li>\r\n<li>Flexibility of Working in different states of US</li>\r\n<li>Authority</li>\r\n<li>Higher Salary</li>\r\n<li>Prestige</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p>To know more about the licensure process, please visit the \"Magazine\" section from top menu and go through various articles posted there.</p>",
