    "content_html": "<div class=\"text-center\">\r\n<button type=\"button\" class=\"btn btn-light shadow-lg\">$\\cos\\ 2\\alpha = \\cos^2 \\alpha  - \\sin^2 \\alpha$ <span class=\"text-muted\">&emsp; &emsp; &emsp; Page 38</span></button>\r\n</div><br/>\r\n\r\n<p>Replacing <span class=\"math inline\">\\(\\cos^2\r\n\\alpha\\)</span> with <span class=\"math inline\">\\(1-\\sin^2\r\n\\alpha\\)</span> or replacing <span class=\"math inline\">\\(\\sin^2\r\n\\alpha\\)</span> with <span class=\"math inline\">\\(1-\\cos^2\r\n\\alpha\\)</span>, we get two additional formulae for <span\r\nclass=\"math inline\">\\(\\cos\\ 2\\alpha\\)</span></p>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"text-center\">\r\n<button type=\"button\" class=\"btn btn-light shadow-lg\">$\\begin{align*}\r\n\\cos\\ 2\\alpha  &= 1 - 2\\ \\sin^2 \\alpha \\\\\r\n\\cos\\ 2\\alpha  &= 2\\ \\cos^2 \\alpha - 1\\\\\r\n\\sin\\ 2\\alpha &=  2\\ \\sin \\alpha \\cos \\alpha\\\\\r\n\\tan\\ 2\\alpha &= \\dfrac{2\\tan\\ \\alpha}{1-\\tan^2\\ \\alpha}\r\n\\end{align*}$ <span class=\"text-muted\">&emsp; &emsp; &emsp; Page 38</span></button>\r\n</div><br/>",
