    "subtopic": "Expected Value of a Discrete Function",
    "content_html": "<h5><span><b>Expected Value of a Discrete Function:</b></span></h5>\r\n<div class=\"text-center\">\r\n <button type=\"button\" class=\"btn btn-light shadow-lg\">$\\mu = E(X) = \\displaystyle \\sum_{k=1}^n x_k\\  f(x_k)$ <span class=\"text-muted\">&emsp; &emsp; &emsp; Page 66</span></button>\r\n</div><br/>",
    "important": "Discrete Expected Value:\r\n\\[\\mu = E(X) = \\displaystyle \\sum_{k=1}^n x_k\\ f(x_k)\\]",
    "resources": "<div class=\"mt-4 pt-4 border-t border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-700 flex flex-wrap gap-2\"><a href=\"https://drive.google.com/file/d/1x98FMuTm_acKnZW_4S5tXuQfYWoVTX1K/preview\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"px-3 py-1.5 bg-purple-100 dark:bg-purple-900/40 text-purple-700 dark:text-purple-300 rounded text-xs font-bold hover:bg-purple-200 transition-colors\">👨‍🏫 Tutoring</a></div>",
