    "topic": "Comparison of Samples",
    "subtopic": "Overview",
    "content_html": "<p>Confidence Interval for the Difference Between Two Means $\\mu_1$ and $\\mu_2$:</p>\r\n\r\n<p>When standard deviations are known:</p>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"text-center\">\r\n<button type=\"button\" class=\"btn btn-light shadow-lg\">$\\bar{X_1} - \\bar {X_2} - Z_{\\alpha/2} \\sqrt{\\left(\\dfrac{\\sigma_1^2}{n_1} + \\dfrac{\\sigma_2^2}{n_2}\\right)} \\leq \\mu_1 - \\mu_2 \\leq \\bar{X_1} - \\bar {X_2} + Z_{\\alpha/2} \\sqrt{\\left(\\dfrac{\\sigma_1^2}{n_1} + \\dfrac{\\sigma_2^2}{n_2}\\right)}$ <span class=\"text-muted\">&emsp; &emsp; &emsp; Page 75</span></button>\r\n</div><br/>",
