    "chapter": "Torsion",
    "topic": "Hollow, Thin Walled Shafts",
    "subtopic": "Overview",
    "content_html": "<div class=\"text-center\">\r\n<button type=\"button\" class=\"btn btn-light shadow-lg\">$\\tau = \\dfrac{T}{2A_Mt}$ <span class=\"text-muted\">&emsp; &emsp; &emsp; Page 135</span></button>\r\n</div><br/>\r\n\r\nwhere,<br/>\r\nt = Thickness of shaft wall,<br/>\r\nA$_m$ = Area of a solid shaft of radius equal to the mean radius of the hollow shaft.",
    "important": "",
