    "discipline": "Civil",
    "subject": "Mechanics of Materials",
    "chapter": "Columns",
    "topic": "Column Buckling",
    "subtopic": "Overview",
    "content_html": "<h5><span><b>Buckling:</b></span></h5>\r\n\r\n<p>Buckling can be defined as the sudden large deformation of structure due to a slight increase of an existing load under which the structure had exhibited little, if any, deformation before the load was increased.</p>",
