    "content_html": "<div class= \"container-fluid\">\r\n  <div class= \"row align-items-start\">\r\n   <div class=\"col col-lg-8\">\r\n   <div class=\"text-center\">\r\n<button type=\"button\" class=\"btn btn-light shadow-lg\">$U = W = \\dfrac{P\\delta}{2}$ <span class=\"text-muted\">&emsp; &emsp; &emsp; Page 138</span></button>\r\n</div><br/>\r\n\r\nThe strain energy per unit volume is:\r\n<div class=\"text-center\">\r\n<button type=\"button\" class=\"btn btn-light shadow-lg\">$u = \\dfrac{U}{AL} = \\dfrac{\\sigma^2}{2E}$ <span class=\"text-muted\">&emsp; &emsp; &emsp; Page 138</span></button>\r\n</div><br/>\r\n    </div>\r\n    <div class=\"col\">\r\n<center><p><img src=\"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/2/20/Section_5_Image_2.png\" style=\"max-width: 50vh;\"></p><br/>\r\n<small><small><a href=\"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Section_5_Image_2.png\">LukeSRoss</a>, <a href=\"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0\">CC BY-SA 4.0</a>, via Wikimedia Commons<br/></small></small></center>\r\n    </div>\r\n  </div>\r\n</div>",
