    "subtopic": "Moment of Area",
    "content_html": "The moment of area is calculated exactly the same way as if you are calculating moment of a force. The only change will be force is replaced by mass.\r\n<div class=\"text-center\">\r\n<button type=\"button\" class=\"btn btn-light shadow-lg\">$M_{ax} = \\Sigma x_n a_n$ <span class=\"text-muted\">&emsp; &emsp; &emsp; Page 95</span></button>\r\n</div><br/>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"text-center\">\r\n<button type=\"button\" class=\"btn btn-light shadow-lg\">$M_{ay} = \\Sigma y_n a_n$ <span class=\"text-muted\">&emsp; &emsp; &emsp; Page 95</span></button>\r\n</div><br/>",
